## 3️⃣ Quick “blank-map” checklist (in case you still see a white canvas)

| Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---------|--------------|-----|
| **Map loads but shows nothing** | Still a `mapbox://` URL somewhere (style, source, sprite, glyphs). | Search the whole project for `mapbox://` and replace. |
| **404 / 401 errors** | A Mapbox token or API endpoint is still being called (geocoding, directions, tiles). | Remove the token, switch to an open service (Nominatim, OSRM, etc.) and update the plugin. |
| **`map.setFog is not a function`** | Using Mapbox v2 fog API. | Replace with `map.setSky({…})` and add a `sky` layer in the style. |
| **Controls look unstyled** | CSS class names still `mapboxgl-…`. | Rename to `maplibregl-…` or import the MapLibre-specific CSS. |
| **`map.loadImage` throws “callback not a function”** | Using the old callback signature. | Switch to `const {data} = await map.loadImage(url);` (or `.then`). |

