## 4️⃣ TL;DR – Minimal code change for the camera

```js
// BEFORE (Mapbox v2)
map.setFreeCameraOptions({
  position: [lng, lat, altitude],
  bearing: 45,
  pitch: 60,
  roll: 0
});

// AFTER (MapLibre)
const cam = map.calculateCameraOptionsFromCameraLngLatAltRotation(
  [lng, lat],          // lng/lat
  altitude,           // metres above sea level
  45,                 // bearing
  60,                 // pitch
  0                   // roll
);
map.jumpTo(cam);   // or map.easeTo(cam) / map.flyTo(cam)
```

That single replacement, together with the namespace & style changes described above, will get your map back to the same visual result you had with Mapbox’s free-camera API.

